        <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconCloud">M19.35 10.04C18.67 6.59 15.64 4 12 4 9.11 4 6.6 5.64 5.35 8.04 2.34 8.36 0 10.91 0 14c0 3.31 2.69 6 6 6h13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5 0-2.64-2.05-4.78-4.65-4.96zM19 18H6c-2.21 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.05 1.53-3.76 3.56-3.97l1.07-.11.5-.95C8.08 7.14 9.94 6 12 6c2.62 0 4.88 1.86 5.39 4.43l.3 1.5 1.53.11c1.56.1 2.78 1.41 2.78 2.96 0 1.65-1.35 3-3 3z</StreamGeometry>
